From: Tiago Damascena <tiagobdamascena@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Kconfig: depend on USB and CFG80211, not MMC

A USB Wi-Fi driver that registers on cfg80211 has nothing to do with MMC;
the dependency is a leftover from the SDIO sibling. In tree, "depends on
MMC" would hide the option on a kernel that has USB and cfg80211 and no
MMC, and let it be enabled without cfg80211, which does not link.

--- a/Kconfig	2026-09-10 17:53:30.775059451 -0300
+++ b/Kconfig	2026-09-10 17:53:30.804154716 -0300
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 config RTL8733BU
-	depends on MMC
+	depends on USB && CFG80211
 	tristate "Realtek 8733B USB WiFi"
 	help
 	  Realtek RTL8733BU chipset driver

